<% content_for :title, "OAuth 2.0" %>

<div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
  <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-100 mb-4">OAuth 2.0</h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 mb-8">
    Integrate with phish.directory using OAuth 2.0 authorization flows.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">Overview</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
    phish.directory supports OAuth 2.0 for secure third-party integrations. Applications can request
    authorization to access user data on behalf of users.
  </p>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">Supported Grant Types</h2>
  <ul class="text-slate-300 space-y-2 mb-6">
    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="text-cyan-accent mt-1">✓</span>
      <span><strong class="text-slate-100">Authorization Code</strong> — For server-side applications</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="text-cyan-accent mt-1">✓</span>
      <span><strong class="text-slate-100">Authorization Code with PKCE</strong> — For single-page and mobile apps</span>
    </li>
    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
      <span class="text-cyan-accent mt-1">✓</span>
      <span><strong class="text-slate-100">Client Credentials</strong> — For service-to-service authentication</span>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">Endpoints</h2>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-8">
    <table class="w-full text-left">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/50">
          <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">Endpoint</th>
          <th class="py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">URL</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-sm">
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100">Authorization</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400 font-mono">https://phish.directory/oauth/authorize</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100">Token</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400 font-mono">https://phish.directory/oauth/token</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100">Token Revocation</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400 font-mono">https://phish.directory/oauth/revoke</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100">UserInfo</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400 font-mono">https://phish.directory/oauth/userinfo</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">Scopes</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
    Available OAuth scopes:
  </p>
  <div class="overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-8">
    <table class="w-full text-left">
      <thead>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/50">
          <th class="py-3 pr-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">Scope</th>
          <th class="py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300">Description</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-sm">
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100 font-mono">openid</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400">Required for OpenID Connect</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100 font-mono">profile</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400">User's name and profile information</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="border-b border-slate-700/30">
          <td class="py-3 pr-4 text-slate-100 font-mono">email</td>
          <td class="py-3 text-slate-400">User's email address and verification status</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">Authorization Code Flow</h2>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">Step 1: Redirect to Authorization</h3>
  <div class="bg-pd-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-6">
    <div class="text-slate-100">
      GET https://phish.directory/oauth/authorize<br>
      <span class="pl-4">?client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID</span><br>
      <span class="pl-4">&redirect_uri=https://yourapp.com/callback</span><br>
      <span class="pl-4">&response_type=code</span><br>
      <span class="pl-4">&scope=openid+profile+email</span><br>
      <span class="pl-4">&state=RANDOM_STATE</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">Step 2: Exchange Code for Token</h3>
  <div class="bg-pd-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-6">
<pre class="text-slate-100">POST https://phish.directory/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code
&code=AUTHORIZATION_CODE
&redirect_uri=https://yourapp.com/callback
&client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID
&client_secret=YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET</pre>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">Token Response</h3>
  <div class="bg-pd-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-6">
<pre class="text-slate-100">{
  "access_token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIs...",
  "token_type": "Bearer",
  "expires_in": 7200,
  "refresh_token": "abc123...",
  "scope": "openid profile email"
}</pre>
  </div>

  <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-100 mt-8 mb-4">UserInfo Endpoint</h2>
  <p class="text-slate-300 mb-4">
    After obtaining an access token, retrieve user information:
  </p>
  <div class="bg-pd-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-6">
    <div class="text-slate-100">
      curl https://phish.directory/oauth/userinfo \<br>
      <span class="pl-4">-H "Authorization: Bearer ACCESS_TOKEN"</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-100 mt-6 mb-3">Response</h3>
  <div class="bg-pd-tertiary rounded-xl p-5 font-mono text-sm overflow-x-auto not-prose mb-6">
<pre class="text-slate-100">{
  "sub": "PDU1a2b3c4d",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "email_verified": true,
  "name": "John Doe",
  "given_name": "John",
  "family_name": "Doe",
  "preferred_username": "johndoe",
  "picture": "https://phish.directory/u/PDU1a2b3c4d/avatar"
}</pre>
  </div>

  <div class="bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl p-4 not-prose mb-8">
    <div class="font-semibold text-amber-400 mb-1">Note</div>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-300">
      OAuth application registration is currently managed by phish.directory administrators.
      Contact us if you need to integrate with OAuth.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
